stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Pending : customer applies<br/>validated against type limits
    Pending --> Active : admin approves<br/>amount credited to account
    Pending --> Rejected : admin rejects with reason
    Active --> Active : pay EMI (paid + 1)
    Active --> Closed : last EMI paid
    Active --> Closed : prepay outstanding principal
    Rejected --> [*]
    Closed --> [*]
